# Browser
# Uldaros Theorix and what Bot1's page says at each question (CR 115.1, 707.12, 701.23). Entomb searches Bot1's own library
# for a card to put into its graveyard, and says so. Each of Uldaros's eight target slots says what it is for - the card
# type that no other target covers, exiled and copied - rather than the bare "up to one target". The copy is cast without
# paying its mana cost, within what is left of the six mana value, and the question says that, and that it is a copy, which
# it called a card cast from the graveyard. The Adventurer's face is asked as a choice of faces with their costs.

